        ],
        "type": "single_choice",
        "question": "要实现将一个输入的十进制正整数转化为二进制表示，下面横线上应填入的代码为（　　）。\nstack<int> ten2bin(int n) {\n    stack<int> st;\n    int r, m;\n    r = n % 2;\n    m = n / 2;\n    st.push(r);\n    while (m != 1) {\n        r = m % 2;\n        st.push(r);\n        m = m / 2;\n    }\n    st.push(m);\n    return st;\n}\n// main 中: while (!bin.empty()) { ____________; }",
        "options": {
            "A": "cout << bin.top(); bin.pop();",
            "B": "bin.pop(); cout << bin.top();",
            "C": "cout << bin.back(); bin.pop();",
            "D": "cout << bin.front(); bin.pop();"
        },
        "answer": "A",
        "explanation": "除 2 取余入栈，最高位在栈底；输出须先取栈顶（最高位）再弹栈，从高位到低位打印；栈无 back/front 接口。"
    },
